                                                "sense_id": "066f6b51-4287-38c4-a466-7f66ff456df7",
                                                "text": "The Koreans\nAlmost all the Koreans in China live in the north-eastern provinces. The greatest concentration is found in an area of approximately 1,200 square miles in Kirin Province, an area which is part of the Yen-pien Korean Autonomous Chou."
                                            },
